<title>USA: Halter Marine says completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Halter Marine says completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>GULFPORT, Miss. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halter Marine Group Inc said that a wholly owned subsidiary has completed its acquisition of the remaining common stock of Texas Drydock Inc.</p>
<p>Halter acquired 51 percent of the common stock of Texas</p>
